# Arenas on demand (Moddy-Worlds#58, #59). A plain flat world (no world switched on: the arena's module does not run,
# and the Isle's jar is installed too), and an operator builds two battle arenas in it with /moddy arena create: each
# stands where he stood, with its own prep room, and is listed. The settings command's layers (all arenas, then one
# arena) are what a battle starts with: its countdown says so. A change to an arena whose battle is on is refused,
# and the other arena's settings still change. The first wave comes as real monsters wished in under the arena's
# red pillars.
# play-timeout: 600
@intent arenas built by command in a plain world, two of them each with its own battle; the config's layers reach a battle's start; a change during that arena's battle is refused while the other arena still changes
@world flat seed=4

@step build the arena north where he stands
@wait 3s
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 600 0 true
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 600 4 true
moddy arena create north
@expect chat /This builds the arena north here/ within 15s
moddy arena create north confirm
@expect chat /Built the arena north/ within 60s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if block ~ ~-1 ~ minecraft:oak_planks
@aim look 0 10
@wait 10t
@shot north-prep-room

@step a second arena, south, far to the east
teleport @s ~300 ~ ~
@wait 3s
moddy arena create south confirm
@expect chat /Built the arena south/ within 60s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if block ~ ~-1 ~ minecraft:oak_planks
moddy arena list
@expect chat /north: prep room at/ within 10s
@expect chat /south: prep room at/ within 10s

@step the settings: all arenas, then one
moddy arena config global countdownSeconds 9
@expect chat /countdownSeconds for all arenas is now 9 seconds/ within 10s
moddy arena config south countdownSeconds 12
@expect chat /countdownSeconds for south is now 12 seconds/ within 10s
moddy arena config south
@expect chat /countdownSeconds = 12 seconds  \(from this arena/ within 10s

@step south's battle starts with its own countdown, and its settings are locked while it is on
moddy arena start south
@expect chat /The first comes in 12/ within 15s
moddy arena config south breatherSeconds 5
@expect chat /A battle is on in south/ within 10s
moddy arena config north breatherSeconds 5
@expect chat /breatherSeconds for north is now 5 seconds/ within 10s

@step the first wave: real monsters wished in under red pillars
@wait 8s
@shot south-pillars-rising
@wait 8s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,distance=..80]
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddy_world_wished,distance=..80]
@aim look 0 20
@wait 10t
@shot south-first-wave
